```python
def norm(s):
    s = s.replace('⊂',' subsetof ').replace('⊆',' subsetof ')
    s = re.sub(r'contained\s+in',' subsetof ', s)
    s = re.sub(r'subset\s+of',' subsetof ', s)
    s = re.sub(r'[^A-Za-z0-9;,]+','', s)  # removes braces, carets, underscores, spaces
    return s.lower()
```
